From 345d72ee99cb6d7de019c1a5535c391cc94d7443 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:26:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 16 missing discovery-only legal candidates (rent, family,
 court organization, social insurance, historical labour laws)

Adds Law 164/2025 and the legacy rent laws, Law 1/2000 (khula procedure), family courts
and fund laws, social insurance, judicial authority, Cassation procedure, lawyers' law,
repealed Law 12/2003 and 125/2010 (needed for temporal questions), vehicle insurance and
traffic law. Metadata only; each entry notes what must be confirmed against the Gazette.
